  "pros": [
    "Unified marketing automation builder with integrated tools (email, landing pages, webinars)",
    "Visual workflow builder simplifies campaign setup and saves time",
    "Drag-and-drop editor and templates make email creation quick and easy"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Flawed contact counting logic leads to unpredictable billing spikes for multiple lists",
    "Limited native sub-account controls for managing separate client data",
    "Key marketing tools are not easily discoverable due to a cluttered navigation menu"
  ],
  "changed": [
    "Con 3: 'Key marketing tools are not easily discoverable due to a cluttered navigation menu' replaced 'Advanced automation and reporting features can have a learning curve' because the note '[friction] There are no top-level links to email, automation or campaigns: the header shows only Tools, Contacts and Reports. Everything else sits inside a 21-item Tools mega-menu, alongside courses, webinars, ads and the website builder' directly points to a discoverability issue for core features, which is a more specific and immediate friction point than a general learning curve for advanced features."
  ]
